- **Time exit:** `custom_exit` sells at or after 23:00 UTC or 12 hours after entry. No indicator is involved.
- **Two-entries-per-day cap:** `confirm_trade_entry` counts the pair''s trades opened on the current UTC date through `Trade.get_trades_proxy`. The unit test does not exercise this cap, because the stubbed Freqtrade has no `Trade` class. It is untested until a real backtest runs.
